	Old_woman (Old_woman_confused): Well, that’s already a step toward the right direction. Take your time.
	catherine: But I don’t have time. He could cure me.But …I couldn't pay his price.
	Old_woman (Old_woman_talking): Then perhaps you should stop thinking about what you could have had.
	catherine: I don't know how.
	Old_woman: Neither did I, when I was your age. But it will come.
